Execute an OpenSearch query against the broker's profile index.

The request body should be a valid OpenSearch query DSL. The query is executed
against the broker-specific index (`insureds-{broker_id}`), ensuring tenant isolation.

**Example Query - Full-text search**:
```json
{
  "query": {
    "multi_match": {
      "query": "acme",
      "fields": ["insured", "domains", "emails"],
      "fuzziness": "AUTO"
    }
  },
  "size": 20
}
```

